A = {1, 2, 5} and B = {2, 4, 5}. Which elements belong to both sets?

A. {1, 4}
B. {5}
C. {1, 2, 4, 5}
D. {2, 5}

A = {p, q, r} and B = {q, s}. What is the set difference A minus B?

A. {q}
B. {p, q, r, s}
C. {p, r}
D. {s}

If U = {1,2,3,4} and A = {1,4}, what is A's complement in U?

A. {1,2,3,4}
B. {2,3}
C. The empty set
D. {1,4}

Which set is empty?

A. {2}
B. {0}
C. {x: x is an even prime}
D. {x: x is an integer greater than 2 and less than 3}

What is the intersection of {a, c, d} and {b, c, d}?

A. {a, b}
B. {a, b, c, d}
C. The empty set
D. {c, d}
